# Original vivo PD2324 init.recovery.mt6989.rc (extracted from stock recovery)
# USB uses configfs (=1) and this controller for UDC binding.
# NOTE: setenforce 0 and mode 1 are temporarily removed to isolate the crash.
# If configfs=1 alone does NOT crash, we add them back using a separate
# non-blocking mechanism (e.g. a oneshot service triggered at boot).
on init
    setprop sys.usb.configfs 1
    setprop sys.usb.controller "11201000.usb0"
